{
 "name": "gpe",
 "label": "Lines 15, 16, 17 and 18",
 "about": "The lines of the Grand Paris Express that are not in the timetable yet, complete, as they are planned to be when the project opens: line 15 as one line from Noisy-Champs round by Pont de Sevres and Saint-Denis Pleyel to Champigny Centre, lines 16, 17 and 18. Run times between stations as published by the Societe des grands projets (2015), line 18 brought to the 30 minutes published in 2019; line 15 east from its length (ASSUMPTION). A train every 2.5 minutes on line 15 (2 to 3 published), every 4 minutes on lines 16, 17 and 18 (ASSUMPTION). A change to a platform that exists within 350 m takes 3 minutes plus the distance at 70 m a minute (ASSUMPTION); the lines of the Grand Paris Express share one platform group where they meet.",
